==Event Information==
The Battle Cats enter the annihilated city of Shoumetsu Toshi for a special collaboration event!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''October 25th (11am) through November 8th, 2021 (11am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Shoumetsu Toshi Collab Capsules'''}}<br>
Powerful Shoumetsu Toshi heroes appear in a special capsule set, only available for a limited time during this collab event!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Boost your power with limited units, only in this set!'''}}<br>
[[Benevolent Souma (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#008000|'''Benevolent Souma (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks with change to Slow and Weaken Angels and Aliens!<br>
[[Mystery Girl Yuki (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Mystery Girl Yuki (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks with Massive damage versus Floating enemies!<br>
[[Crazed Yuki (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Crazed Yuki (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks with Massive damage versus Red and Black enemies!<br>
[[Lost World Yuki (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Lost World Yuki (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks with Massive damage versus Angels and Aliens!<br>
[[Otaku Geek Cat (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Otaku Geek Cat (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Long-range attacks that 100% Weaken non-Metal enemies!<br>
[[Souma Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#800080|'''Souma Cat (Rare)'''}}]]<br>
100% Chance of Wave Attack!

{{Color|#FF0000|※ At present, the Shoumetsu Toshi Collab Capsules event banner intended to be displayed at the Rare Capsules machine is not correctly appearing for players using French, Italian, German or Spanish language settings. Although the banner may not display as intended, capsule machine functions are working as intended for this set and draws may be made as usual.}}

※ Please note that draws from the Shoumetsu Toshi rare capsule setmay provide regularly appearing rare Cat units. Shoumetsu Toshi collab units will not be available from other scheduled Rare Capsule sets appearing during the collaboration.<br>
※ If Shoumetsu Toshi content does not appear in your version of The Battle Cats, please update to the most recent version of the app.<br>
※ Mystery Girl Yuki, Crazed Yuki, and Lost World Yuki may be upgraded to her True Form after reaching Level 30 and collecting the required amounts of XP and Catfruit.<br>
※ Mystery Girl Yuki, Crazed Yuki, and Lost World Yuki may be evolved to their True Form even after the collab event ends.

{{Color|#FF0000|'''● Collab Stages in The Battle Cats!'''}}<br>
Help Shoumetsu Toshi heroes seek the truth behind the destruction of the city in limited collab stages!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Collab Map: "Annihilated City"'''}}<br>
Visit the Legend Stories/Event Stories to check out the Annihilated City map! 7 stages, with an Insane-difficulty final stage awaiting you at the end!<br>
Get bigger and better rewards with a higher Timed Score!

※Tap the Timed Score button on the map menu to see a list of available prizes.<br>
Clearing any stage will give you a small change to unlock the limited collab character [[Takuya & Yuki (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Takuya & Yuki'''}}]], but more difficult stages have a higher drop rate! (Or, use a Treasure Radar for a 100% chance to unlock the character upon stage clear.)<br>
※Once received, you can unlock "Takuya & Yuki" by visiting the Rare Cats section of the Upgrade menu.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Collab Maps: "Takuya & Yuki Awaken" and "The Lost World"'''}}<br>
Stages from these maps will be available to challenge from{{Color|#FF0000|'''the third day of the Collab (October 28th at 11am)!'''}}<br>
Clearing any "Takuya & Yuki Awaken" stage will give you a small change to unlock the True Form of collab character {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Takuya & Yuki.'''}}Likewise, clearing any "The Lost World" stage will give you a small change to unlock the limited collab character [[Redhead Yuki Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Redhead Yuki Cat'''}}]]. However, the later, more difficult stages have a higher drop rate! (Or, use a Treasure Radar for a 100% chance to unlock the character upon stage clear.)<br>
※"Takuya & Yuki" may be upgraded to their True Form after reaching Level 20.<br>
※If "Takuya & Yuki Awaken" is cleared before the "Takuya & Yuki" unit is collected, it is possible that you may unlock the True Form before the actual Cat Unit.<br>
※Once received, you can unlock "Redhead Yuki Cat" by visiting the Rare Cats section of the Upgrade menu.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Collab Map: "City of Souls"'''}}<br>
Available to take on throughout the collab event!<br>
Get big XP rewards based on your Timed Score!<br>
Can you clear this Insane-difficulty stage?!

※Tap the  Timed Score button on the map menu to see a list of available prizes.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Collab Map: "The World Beyond"'''}}<br>
Collab stages from {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''"The World Beyond"'''}} will be available {{Color|#FF0000|'''from the fifth day of the collab event (October 30th at 11am)!'''}}<br>
Souma, the boy who wishes only for happiness, departs on a new journey!<br>
Clearing any stage will give you a small change to unlock the limited character [[Kano & Souma (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Kano & Souma'''}}]], but more difficult stages have a higher drop rate! (Or, use a Treasure Radar for a 100% chance to unlock the character upon stage clear.)

※Once received, you can unlock "Kano & Souma" by visiting the Rare Cats section of the Upgrade menu.<br>
※If Shoumetsu Toshi content does not appear in your version of The Battle Cats, please update to the most recent version of the app

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Challenge Map: "Messier's Assault"'''}}<br>
A new expert-class event is available only during this Shoumetsu Toshi event!<br>
Visit the Legend Stories/Event Storeis to check out Messier's Assault! 20 stages, each tougher than the last with mighty boss enemy Messier awaiting your challenge!<br>
Earn amazing rewards with each stage you clear, and a big prize for the brave adventurers who complete the final level!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Collab Missions at the Catclaw Challenges!'''}}<br>
Collect limited-time mission rewards by completing Shoumetsu Toshi stages!<br>
Once you've met the requirements, head to the Catnip Challenges and accept your prizes!<br>
<small><small>※These Special missions can only be completed until June 15th, 2020 at 11:00am, so don't forget to claim your rewards before then!</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Limited GAMATOTO Expedition Events'''}}<br>
White-hat hero The Geek arrives from Shoumetsu Toshi to help Gamatoto on his adventures and unearth even more prizes! Plus, only during this Shoumetsu Toshi collab event, you can send your Gamatoto adventurer to the{{Color|#99CC00|'''limited area "Shoumetsu Toshi"'''}} for a ton of extra XP!<br>
Don't miss this special chance!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Login each day for stamp rewards and a limited edition Cat Unit !'''}}<br>
Awesome login bonuses, available to collect only during this collab event!<br>
Visit The Battle Cats each day during the collab campaign to pick up every stamp and get cool rewards! Plus, your third Login Stamp will unlock the {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Special Collab Unit "'''}}[[Yuki Cat (Special Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Yuki Cat'''}}]]{{Color|#FF00FF|'''".'''}}<br>
Don't forget to login or you'll miss out!

※Once received, you can unlock "Yuki Cat" by visiting the Special Cats section of the Upgrade menu.

